00:57:56,000 --> 00:58:02,000
Lola is a 2024 American drama film written and directed by Nicola Peltz Beckham, who stars alongside
Raven Goodwin, Richie Merritt, Luke David Blumm, Trevor Long, and Virginia Madsen.

12
01:03:12,000 --> 01:03:18,000
The film, released in the United States on February 9, 2024, was universally
panned by critics and grossed just $648 at the box office.

13
01:08:28,000 --> 01:08:34,000
The film explores themes of sibling relationship, dystopia,
world war ii, time machine, anti-nazi resistance.

14
01:13:44,000 --> 01:13:50,000
The tone is lighthearted and emotional and thought_provoking.
